Sculptor
========

Sculptor is an interactive creative world editor for Minecraft 1.7.10 (GT New
Horizons): brushes with live preview, an in-game editor panel, and a cinematic
camera.

It is not a port of, and contains no code from, any all-rights-reserved mod. It
is an independent implementation built on the components listed below.


